    "source_text": "Local V2 design contract from docs/MAC_OPERATOR_V2_DESIGN.md, 2026-10-01. This contract identifier is reserved locally and does not assert an existing KB item. Remove a clean Broker-owned worktree with ownership checks and read-back verification, then delete its task branch with git branch -d (kept with a warning when it has unmerged commits); never delete the primary repository."
